e": "7.png", "id": "1739366730778256", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619382_1739366734111589_8186870986444138126_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-iceZkGglywQ7kNvwH_Tup-&_nc_oc=AdpCoEgXZuvIZtjjWVmV2_2lwjcZvcvTNi0VZg6j7wlC_uQRcLjONOeiSxq3hBScDpQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIhklGjM3lIm7IUFE-gQdqIBIRkp4Rk13gkbI7lkjaKPQ&oe=6AB271CF"}, {"file_name": "IMAGE.png", "id": "1770241050641774", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624424_1770241053975107_1420108566179552283_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JyfKe4fhNE4Q7kNvwG16iES&_nc_oc=AdqFJoR_Ts2b9Zfluasz1x7v9jS-9DzfvKSl7p3p8hHFHvzNnnfk_uJECAmod2ENuYU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLzWOHScpzWQ6OJgdQGXSeO2zb1poOPI-Ggt03iVMIRkQ&oe=6AB27E5F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "3475002012649489", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619588_3475002019316155_6224022519921264569_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ay8v-GkzwjYQ7kNvwG-g3ab&_nc_oc=AdplZzgoZ1Yg2oupUxUlgokEkUYM1LWGHmuXgkBVz1ydWCeecGB5toJc3CCuf4yKECc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQINq7C_DXyiAm1CK9xGeH6saH6iIa9xZ4uyyQ034_E6_Q&oe=6AB28285"}, "display_name": "Vocab Clash", "keywords": ["learning", "vocabulary", "English", "Chinese", "sport"], "long_description": "Vocab Clash is a VR action vocabulary game that combines language learning with full-body gameplay. Choose to learn English or Chinese and challenge yourself across boxing, darts, table tennis, adventure escape levels, and AI battles.\n\nInstead of relying on traditional word lists, translations, or dictionary definitions, Vocab Clash helps you understand vocabulary through images, sentence context, and physical interaction.\n\nThe game features two main question types:\n\nImage Questions \u2014 Observe an image, understand the concept it represents, and choose the correct word.\n\nFill-in-the-Blank Questions \u2014 Use the context of a sentence to identify the missing word.\n\nYour answer is not just a button press. You respond through movement:\n\nBoxing \u2014 Punch the correct answer in the ring.\n\nDarts \u2014 Throw darts to hit the correct target.\n\nTable Tennis \u2014 Swing your paddle and drive the ball toward the correct answer.\n\nAdventure Escape \u2014 Answer questions to seal monsters while escaping and dodging pursuit.\n\nAI Battle \u2014 Compete against AI opponents in real-time vocabulary duels.\n\nVocab Clash covers nearly 8,000 English words for TOEFL and IELTS, as well as nearly 8,000 Chinese vocabulary entries. Each entry includes a dedicated image and contextual example sentence.\n\nWhether you are learning English or Chinese, Vocab Clash turns vocabulary practice into an active VR experience where you see, understand, move, and respond.", "short_description": "Vocab Clash is a VR action vocabulary game that combines language learning with full-body movement. Learn English or Chinese through boxing, darts, table tennis, and adventure challenges. The game includes nearly 8,000 English words for TOEFL and IELTS and nearly 8,000 Chinese vocabulary entries, each with a dedicated image and contextual example sentence."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://zp1412042552-hue.github.io/vocab-clash-website/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ZP Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://zp1412042552-hue.github.io/vocab-clash-website/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "pl